  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Saj Food Products Private Limited vs State Of West Bengal & Ors on 14 May, 2025 Author: Amrita Sinha Bench: Amrita Sinha 14.05.2025 M/L 219 Ct No. 14 Sg Wpa 4343 of 2025 Saj Food Products Private Limited Vs State of West Bengal & Ors. Mr. Abhratosh Majumdar, Sr. Adv. Mr. Sayan Sinha, Mr. Kausheyo Roy, Mr. Adil Naser, Mr. Nilanjan Bhattacharya ...for the petitioner Mr. Amit Mehoria, Ms. T. Singh, Ms. P. Banerjee, Mr. S. Dey. ...for respondent nos. 4 & 5 Mr. Nilotpal Chatterjee, Ms. Munmum Ganguly. ...for the State respondent Mr. Soumen Bhattacharya, Mr. Anindya Kanan, Mr. Aayush Sharma. ...for the Uoi 1. Supplementary affidavit and affidavit-of-service are taken on record. 2. The petitioner is aggrieved by the prohibition order passed under Section 36(3)(B) of Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006 dated 17.01.2025 issued by the District Food Safety Inspecting Officer & Designated Officer (FSSAI) Murshidabad.",
    "facts": "2. The petitioner is aggrieved by the prohibition order passed under Section 36(3)(B) of Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006 dated 17.01.2025 issued by the District Food Safety Inspecting Officer & Designated Officer (FSSAI) Murshidabad. 3. The biscuit under the brand name 'GOOGLY' has been prohibited to be manufactured or sold in the open market for being unsafe for human consumption.",
    "arguments": "4. In respect of the same food sample, an order was passed by the Court in WPA 1887 of 2025, wherein, relying upon the report from the National Food Laboratory, similar prohibitory order was Saj Food Products Private Limited vs State Of West Bengal & Ors on 14 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/109867353/ 1 [LEAKAGE_MASK].",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": "4. In respect of the same food sample, an order was passed by the Court in WPA 1887 of 2025, wherein, relying upon the report from the National Food Laboratory, similar prohibitory order was Saj Food Products Private Limited vs State Of West Bengal & Ors on 14 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/109867353/ 1 [LEAKAGE_MASK]."
